    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG have the pleasure of presenting No. 23 to the market a bright and generously proportioned two-bedroom ground floor apartment. Filled with natural light and available for immediate occupation, this appealing home is sure to attract first-time buyers seeking to step onto the property ladder, as well as investors drawn by the area's strong rental demand and attractive yields.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with a useful storage area off. At the heart of the home is the spacious open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, complete with a larder/storage press and double doors opening onto a sunny south-facing patio. The principal bedroom is equally bright and benefits from double doors opening to the front of the property. A generous second bedroom and a stylish family bathroom complete the accommodation. Residents also enjoy the convenience of plentiful communal parking. \n\nPresented as a blank canvas, No. 23 offers the perfect opportunity for its new owner to personalise the interiors and create a home to suit their own style and taste.\n\nConveniently positioned in the established and ever-popular Kiltipper area, the property enjoys the perfect balance of suburban convenience and the scenic backdrop of the Dublin Mountains. A superb range of local amenities is close at hand, including The Square Shopping Centre, a neighbourhood Eurospar, Cocoon Childcare, Glenview Pitch & Putt, Thomas Davis GAA Club and Tallaght Stadium, home to Shamrock Rovers FC. Excellent transport links include numerous Dublin Bus routes, while the Red Line LUAS at The Square is just 2.5km away, providing quick and easy access to Dublin City Centre. With nearby parks, walking trails and outdoor recreation on the doorstep, this is an ideal location for those seeking both convenience and an active lifestyle."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Spacious 2-bedroom apartment approx. 56sqm.</li><li> Private patio area</li><li> Vacant and ready for immediate occupancy</li><li> Recently deep cleaned and cleared</li><li> Bright open-plan living / kitchen space</li><li> Additional storage room</li><li> Electric heating</li><li> Ample communal parking available</ul>"
